            "markdown_inline": "<p><strong>Bold</strong>, <em>italic</em>, <del>struck</del>, <code>inline code</code>, a <a href=\"https://flarum.org\" rel=\"ugc nofollow\">link</a>, <a href=\"https://example.com\" rel=\"ugc nofollow\">https://example.com</a>, and a bare URL <a href=\"https://discuss.flarum.org\" rel=\"ugc nofollow\">https://discuss.flarum.org</a>.<br>\nA line break above, then a second paragraph.</p>\n\n<p>Second paragraph.</p>",
            "markdown_blocks": "<h1>Heading one</h1>\n\n<h2>Heading two</h2>\n\n<ul><li><p>one</p></li>\n<li><p>two</p>\n  <ul><li>nested</li></ul></li>\n\n<li><p>first</p></li>\n<li><p>second</p></li></ul>\n\n<blockquote class=\"uncited\"><div><p>A quote<br>\nover two lines</p></div></blockquote>\n\n<p>—</p>\n\n<p>After the rule.</p>",
            "code": "<pre><code class=\"language-php\">&lt;?php echo 'hello';</code><script async=\"\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" data-hljs-style=\"github\" integrity=\"sha384-E9ssooeJ4kPel3JD7st0BgS50OLWFEdg4ZOp8lYPy52ctQazOIV37TCvzV8l4cYG\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/s9e/hljs-loader@1.0.34/loader.min.js\"></script><script>\n                    if(window.hljsLoader && !document.currentScript.parentNode.hasAttribute('data-s9e-livepreview-onupdate')) {\n                        window.hljsLoader.highlightBlocks(document.currentScript.parentNode);\n                    }\n                </script></pre>\n\n<pre><code>plain block\n  indented</code><script async=\"\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" data-hljs-style=\"github\" integrity=\"sha384-E9ssooeJ4kPel3JD7st0BgS50OLWFEdg4ZOp8lYPy52ctQazOIV37TCvzV8l4cYG\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/s9e/hljs-loader@1.0.34/loader.min.js\"></script><script>\n                    if(window.hljsLoader && !document.currentScript.parentNode.hasAttribute('data-s9e-livepreview-onupdate')) {\n                        window.hljsLoader.highlightBlocks(document.currentScript.parentNode);\n                    }\n                </script></pre>",
