            "mentions": "<p>Hello <a href=\"http://127.0.0.1:8081/u/bob\" class=\"UserMention\">@bob</a>, and the @“Mods”#g4 group. Replying to <a href=\"http://127.0.0.1:8081/d/5-welcome-to-the-test-forum/2\" class=\"PostMention\" data-id=\"13\">alice</a>.</p>",
